<?php if(mb_strlen($note['report'])<=3500):?><p><a class="wbtn" href="<?=e('https://wa.me/?text='.rawurlencode($note['title']."\n\n".$note['report']))?>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Prepare WhatsApp message</a></p><p>Choose the recipient and review the message in WhatsApp, then send there. The website does not send it automatically.</p><?php else:?><p>This report is too long for a WhatsApp draft. Save the PDF and attach it in WhatsApp.</p><?php endif;?><?php else:?><p>Review the report and save it with approval before email or WhatsApp sharing.</p><?php endif;?></section><?php endif;?></aside></div></main>
